  "evidence": "The freshness test assert_orders_fresh failed with 1 row older than the allowed threshold. The staging model stg_orders simply selects from raw.orders without transformation, and both tables show the same loaded_at range (1992-01-02 to 1998-07-13) and row count (14856). Since the test expects recent data but the source raw.orders contains only historic TPCH data and no new rows, the problem originates in the raw source. No downstream model code is at fault; the source data is missing or not being refreshed, so the issue must be escalated to the source owner."
